00:58:08.400 --> 00:58:16.920
<v Ira Glass>Special thanks today to Nick Podany, Conrad Wilson, Troy Brynelson, Lillian Mongeau Hughes, Faiza Patel and Phil Richard at KCRW.
<v Ira Glass>今天特别感谢尼克·波达尼、康拉德·威尔逊、特洛伊·布林内尔森、莉莲·蒙戈-休斯、法伊扎·帕特尔和KCRW的菲尔·理查德。

